  "prefLabel": "Tra 311.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tra 311.02 Scope. DWI victim fatality signs may be erected upon state highways under the jurisdiction of the department other than limited access divided highways or the ramps and access roadways used to access or exit such highways.\n\nSource. #10165, eff 7-27-12; ss by #13588, eff 3-22-23",
